"large language model (LLM) extraction of event data from Telegram messages. "
"These providers are based in the United States. Transfers are covered by "
"Standard Contractual Clauses (SCC) pursuant to Art. 44ff GDPR. Only public "
"event data (titles, dates, venues) is sent to LLM providers; no user "
"personal data is included."
msgstr ""
