#: templates/pages/privacy.html:266
msgid "Automated processing (Art. 13(2)(f) GDPR)"
msgstr "Automatisierte Verarbeitung (Art. 13 Abs. 2 lit. f DSGVO)"

#: templates/pages/privacy.html:268
msgid ""
"Event data is extracted from Telegram messages using a large language model "
